<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets 13.84 pct bond coupon.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 13.84 pct bond coupon.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry has set a 13.84 percent rate for the fifth coupon for series 24008 OFZ interest-bearing bond, the ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>			    pct	   rbls     payment date</p>
<p>   Fifth coupon	 13.84	 34,500   Oct 15, 1997</p>
<p>   Fourth coupon	30.19	 75,268   July 16, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
